.DS_Store

# Catenet's own local state: derived graph, events, proposals. policy.yaml is shared and committed.
# A pattern containing a slash only matches at the root, so use **/ to cover nested repos (e.g. fixtures).
**/.catenet/*
!**/.catenet/policy.yaml

# Spike scratch output (databases, generated inputs)
spikes/data/
